{"text": " I hid the girl who died her favorite pet. She found out about it only after returning from the trip. His name was Gas. It was a homemade snake that she had been growing for 8 years. Yes, a snake. For someone, it was a strange pet, but for her, it was a part of the family. Gas was already old. We knew that he had to stay for a long time. But when he died, I still couldn't stand it and cried. And my girl was in another country at the time, on her brother's birthday. She had a hard relationship with her family for a long time, and only recently they began to get along. She really wanted to become closer to her relatives again, and this trip was important to her. And now I had to decide what to do. Call and say that Gas died. She would be terribly upset and the whole trip could go to the smarke. Or let her spend these few days with her family, and then tell everything personally. I chose the second option. When she arrived, I met her at the airport and told the truth. I told her that Gas died, and that I didn't tell anything on purpose until she was in the departure. She kept quiet the whole way home. At home, we put Gas in the prepared box in advance and buried her together. Then she told me, I still love you, but right now I don't like you at all. I understood why she was angry and didn't start arguing. A little later, I cooked dinner. We sat behind the table and both cried. And before sleep, I carefully asked. Didn't I get better today than on the couch? She answered that I'm done if I'm going to sleep somewhere except our bed. No, we didn't part. We are still together. And Gas is still missing both of us. I don't regret that I waited for her return, but I understand perfectly why she was angry at me then.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 6.3, "text": " I hid the girl who died her favorite pet. She found out about it only after returning from the trip.", "tokens": [50364, 286, 16253, 264, 2013, 567, 4539, 720, 2954, 3817, 13, 1240, 